OL,3,ACoach crash kills several people in
OL,4,ASwiss Alps
OL,5,
OL,6,FA tourist coach has crashed in the
OL,7,Fsouth-eastern Swiss Alps, leaving
OL,8,Fseveral people dead and several
OL,9,Finjured, local police say.
OL,11,FThe bus overturned between Susch and
OL,12,FZernez in the Graubunden - also known
OL,13,Fas Grisons - region late on Thursday
OL,14,Fafternoon.
OL,16,FA large team of rescuers equipped with
OL,17,Fseveral helicopters was deployed to the
OL,18,Fscene.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
