OL,3,ACoach crash kills several people in
OL,4,ASwiss Alps
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome 48 Dutch passengers were on board
OL,7,Fthe bus, according to a spokeswoman for
OL,8,Fthe General Dutch Association of Travel
OL,9,FCompanies on behalf of tour operator
OL,10,FOAD.
